{"articleNo":"2701","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2701&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2011학년도 1학기 농촌출신대학생 학자금융자 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.01.05","hit":"13056","attachments":[{"name":"농촌학자금세부시행계획(2011-1학기).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2701&attachNo=1578"},{"name":"자료7_어업종사자확인서(양식).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2701&attachNo=2065"},{"name":"자료9_연대채무약정서(양식).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2701&attachNo=2422"},{"name":"자료6_영농종사자확인서(양식).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2701&attachNo=2548"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp; <span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #0000cc; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">2011- 1학기&nbsp; 농촌출신대학생 학자금융자 신청 안내 </span>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">1. 신청 대상</span>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font size=\"2\">- 농어촌지역에 주소를 두고 6개월 이상 거주하고 있는 학부모의 자녀 또는 본인<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 신입생, 재학생(복학생, 편입생, 재입학생포함) - 대학원생제외</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">. 성적기준&nbsp;&nbsp;<br></span></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\"><font size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 신입생 : 성적제한없음<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\"><font size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 재학생 : 직전학기 평점평균 1.6이상, 12학점 이상이수자-계절학기성적제외<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"><font size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 졸업학기 학생과 장애우학생은 12학점 미만 이수자도 신청 가능&nbsp; </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">3. 신청 및 서류제출 기간<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">&nbsp;<font size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 신입생 : 2011. 01. 03(월) ~ 01. 14(금)&nbsp; 18:00까지<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<font size=\"2\"> </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><font size=\"2\">- 재학생 : 2011. 01. 24(월) ~ 02. 04(금)&nbsp; 18:00까지</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">4. 지원금액</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"> : <font size=\"2\">등록금(입학금포함) 범위 내 신청액 전액 무이자 융자</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">5. 신청방법</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 학자금지원통합시스템(</font></span><a href=\"http://scholar.kosaf.go.kr/\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font size=\"2\">http://www.kosaf.go.kr</font></span></a><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font size=\"2\">) 접속 → 학자금대출안내 → 농촌</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font size=\"2\">출신대학생<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 학자금 → 신청하기 클릭 → 회원가입 또는 로그인<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 학자금융자 신청양식의 기재사항을 입력 후 증빙서류 확인 후 제출<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font size=\"2\">&nbsp;※ 신청학생은 로그인 후 신청하여야 하며, 약정서 동의 시 공인인증서로 재확인함에&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; 따라 반드시 학생은 공인인증서 필요</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\">6. 제출서류 : 【공통서류】</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"193\" bgcolor=\"#d6d6d6\" height=\"24\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><font size=\"2\">구&nbsp; 분</font></span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"442\" bgcolor=\"#d6d6d6\" height=\"24\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><font size=\"2\">제출서류</font></span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"193\" height=\"71\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">부모 공인인증서 동의시</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">(<font size=\"2\">인터넷)</font></span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"442\" height=\"71\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font size=\"2\">① 융자신청서 (포털 신청화면에서 자동출력)<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font size=\"2\">② 학부모(보호자)기준 주민등록등본<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font size=\"2\">③ 학부모(보호자)기준 가족관계증명서</font></span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"193\" height=\"148\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font size=\"2\">부모 공인인증서 불가시</font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font size=\"2\">(서류제출)</font></span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"442\" height=\"148\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font size=\"2\">① 융자신청서 (포털 신청화면에서 자동출력)<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font size=\"2\">② 학부모(보호자)기준 주민등록등본<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font size=\"2\">③ 학부모(보호자)기준 가족관계증명서<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font size=\"2\">④ 학부모(보호자) 연대채무확약서<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font size=\"2\">⑤ 학부모(보호자)기준 인감증명서<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><font size=\"2\">⑥ 학부모(보호자)기준 신분증 사본</font></span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">【</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\">추가제출】※ 해당자에 한함</span></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"219\" bgcolor=\"#d6d6d6\" height=\"20\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><font size=\"2\">구&nbsp; 분</font></span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"264\" bgcolor=\"#d6d6d6\" height=\"20\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><font size=\"2\">제출서류</font></span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"155\" bgcolor=\"#d6d6d6\" height=\"20\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><font size=\"2\">비고</font></span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"219\" height=\"61\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">보호자 <font size=\"2\">또는 본인이 농어업을</font></span></font><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"> 종사하는 경우</span></font></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"264\" height=\"61\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><font size=\"2\">ㅇ 어업허가증, 어업면허증 등</font></span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"155\" height=\"61\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt\">농지원부, 어선원부는</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"> 제출생략 가능(일괄전산조회)</span></font></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"219\" height=\"61\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">보호자 또는 본인이 농어업에</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt\">종사는 하고 있으나 관련 서류가</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"> 없는 경우</span></font></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"264\" height=\"61\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 18.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -18.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\">ㅇ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt\">영농종사자확인서 또는 어업</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; LETTER-SPACING: -1.8pt\">종사</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">자</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\">확인서</span></font></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"155\" height=\"61\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><font size=\"2\">읍면 동장, 어촌계장 등 확인</font></span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"219\" height=\"24\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><font size=\"2\">국민기초생활수급자</font></span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"264\" height=\"24\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><font size=\"2\">ㅇ 국민기초생활보장수급자증명서</font></span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"155\" height=\"24\">\n           